  <p class="mb-4">Zero to one, from nothing. Built it because I was locked out of the startup ecosystem for being at the wrong university. So I built the thing I wasn't invited to.</p>

  <p class="mb-4">Gathered the founding team, incorporated as eingetragener Verein, got gemeinnützig status. Launch event sold out the community space at a WeWork — first time in Germany. Ran a pitching competition. Startups in the ecosystem raised ~€1M during my time.</p>

  <p class="mb-4">London and Paris chapters came later. I helped those chapter leads where I could — sometimes an event, sometimes just a call — and did the same for the other German chapters. Then I handed Hamburg over.</p>

  <p class="text-grey mt-10">More details coming soon.</p>
